@consumer = http://localhost:4136/odata/v4/shop
@providerV2 = http://localhost:4146/odata/v2/provider

### Delegate over OData V2 — the consumer surface is still OData V4
GET {{consumer}}/Customers

### Renames via V2 (remote price → unitPrice); CAP handles V2 translation
GET {{consumer}}/Products?$filter=unitPrice gt 100

### Entity-level rename via V2
GET {{consumer}}/Suppliers

### The raw upstream V2 service (note the V2 response envelope)
GET {{providerV2}}/Customers
Accept: application/json
